    {
      "index": 0,
      "mapName": "Secret 1 - Lost at Sea.h3m",
      "regionText": "While on a three-hour sight seeing tour Sir Christian's ship was blown off course by a sudden summer storm. When the storm cleared the captain and crew had no idea what their position might be. For nearly a week they sailed under an overcast sky, completely unable to determine their heading. Finally, a small rocky island was spotted. While landing their ship a large rock found it's way into the hull making the craft irreapirable.The curious natives seemed friendly in meeting with Sir Christian. They agreed to help him get off the island if he built them a capitol.",
      "prologText": "All I wanted was a simple vacation.  One hurriance later and I am here on this island with these foul smelling natives.  Perhaps my father was right when I told him about my dream to become a fragrance alchemist.  Maybe my military training can help me get off this forsaken sand prision.",
